# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Information Security Program Overview
**Document ID**: SEC-001
**Classification**: Internal
**Last Updated**: January 2025

---

## Executive Summary

MedSync Health maintains a comprehensive information security program designed to protect patient health information (PHI), customer data, and corporate assets. Our security program is built on industry best practices and regulatory requirements including HIPAA, HITRUST, and SOC 2.

