## Security Architecture

### Defense in Depth

| Layer | Controls |
|-------|----------|
| Perimeter | WAF, DDoS protection, firewall |
| Network | Segmentation, IDS/IPS, VPN |
| Host | EDR, hardening, patching |
| Application | SAST, DAST, API security |
| Data | Encryption, DLP, access control |
| Identity | MFA, SSO, RBAC, PAM |

### Cloud Security

| Component | Provider | Security Controls |
|-----------|----------|-------------------|
| Primary Cloud | AWS (us-east-1, us-west-2) | VPC, Security Groups, WAF |
| DR Region | AWS (eu-west-1) | Cross-region replication |
| CDN | CloudFront | Edge security, DDoS |
| DNS | Route 53 | DNSSEC, health checks |

### Data Classification

| Classification | Description | Controls |
|----------------|-------------|----------|
| Restricted | PHI, credentials, keys | Encryption, strict access, audit |
| Confidential | Customer data, financials | Encryption, need-to-know |
| Internal | Business data, docs | Standard controls |
| Public | Marketing, public docs | Minimal |

