## Key Security Controls

### Identity & Access Management

| Control | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Single Sign-On | Okta for all employees |
| Multi-Factor Authentication | Required for all systems |
| Privileged Access | CyberArk PAM |
| Access Reviews | Quarterly certification |
| Least Privilege | Role-based access (RBAC) |

### Data Protection

| Control | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Encryption at Rest | AES-256 |
| Encryption in Transit | TLS 1.3 |
| Key Management | AWS KMS + HashiCorp Vault |
| Data Loss Prevention | Microsoft DLP |
| Backup Encryption | AES-256 |

### Network Security

| Control | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Web Application Firewall | AWS WAF + Cloudflare |
| DDoS Protection | AWS Shield Advanced |
| Intrusion Detection | AWS GuardDuty |
| VPN | Tailscale for remote access |
| Network Segmentation | VPC isolation |

### Endpoint Security

| Control | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Endpoint Detection | CrowdStrike Falcon |
| Mobile Device Management | Jamf (Mac), Intune (Windows) |
| Disk Encryption | FileVault, BitLocker |
| Patch Management | Automated + 30-day SLA |

